{
	"source": "Built by hand from OpenRouter's API documentation on 2026-10-29: the Video Generation guide (submitting, polling and downloading, its job statuses and webhooks) and the API references to submit a video generation request, poll its status and download its content. A failure the live API cannot be asked for is not recorded.",
